FILE: vUX-cShapes.js
FEATURE: component-teardown
DATE: 2026-09-17
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'resizer-docs'

REASON
CShapes itself holds no listeners, timers or injected DOM, so it has no destroy(); the
only ongoing work in the file is the requestAnimationFrame loop inside animatedRectangle(),
which already had stop(). stop() halts the loop but leaves the last frame painted, which
matters when the consumer reuses the canvas. destroy() on that returned object stops the
loop and clears the canvas, and the target canvas is now remembered so it can do so.

